{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XJLFLwmp37PfA7gfiL96qD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experimental data for the \"worst\" tier scenario for every \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan. I need to carefully go through each planned experiment and generate realistic worst-case data that aligns with the worst-tier definition provided.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n- plan_002: LoRA expert training (planned)\n- plan_003: Meta-Brain assembly (planned)\n- plan_004: Oracle routing ablation (planned)\n\n\n- plan_005: Ablation ladder (planned)\n- plan_006: FTM/FLA reproduction (planned)\n- plan_007: Parameter efficiency analysis (planned)\n- plan_008: Correction Memory ablation (planned)\n- plan_009: Router architecture comparison (planned)\n- plan_010: 6-class vs 3-class routing (planned)\n- plan_013: Rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA (planned)\n- plan_014: LoRA rank sweep (planned)\n- plan_015: Clean LIBERO evaluation (planned)\n- plan_011: Cross-backbone validation (planned)\n- plan_012: LoRA layer placement ablation (planned)\n\nNow I'm looking at the worst-tier key metrics to understand what constitutes failure across these experiments. Now I'm looking at the remaining performance ranges and need to construct a coherent worst-case narrative where routing provides minimal gains over simple capacity scaling. I'll anchor the numbers around frozen baseline at 53.6%, push rank-16 to 58%, rank-48 to 63%, and keep meta-brain just barely ahead at 64% to show that the universal LoRA nearly matches the specialized approach. Looking at the rank sweep results, routing provides modest gains at r16 and r64, staying within the expected confidence intervals. Now I'm constructing the full YAML with detailed per-perturbation breakdowns for each experiment. For the LoRA expert training setup, I'm setting baseline performance where each expert performs well on its own type—Visual around 68%, Spatial at 63%, Physical at 55%—with small cross-type drops of 2-3pp to reflect that the experts are fairly interchangeable despite their specialization. Now I'm looking at the Meta-Brain assembly approach, which achieves 64% overall by breaking down performance across seven specific perturbation subtypes—camera, lighting, background, noise, layout, and robot variations. The visual perturbations cluster around 67%, spatial stays at 62%, and physical drops to 54%, suggesting the routing mechanism should favor visual expertise while keeping the expert assignments relatively balanced rather than heavily specialized.\n\nThe oracle routing experiment reveals a 6-point gap between Meta-Brain and oracle performance, which is substantial enough to indicate that routing quality itself isn't the limiting factor—the real constraint is that individual experts lack sufficient specialization to begin with. Looking at the ablation ladder, Meta-Brain's 2-point improvement over random routing isn't statistically significant across five seeds, and the 1-point gain over universal LoRA is similarly marginal, which directly undermines the core claim about routing effectiveness. I'm now moving into reproducing the FTM and FLA baselines on visual tasks to establish proper comparison points. perturbations: ~72% (strong on visual-only)\n- Meta-Brain LoRA-V on visual: ~67%\n- Meta-Brain advantage: handles spatial/physical (but poorly)\n\n**plan_007: Parameter efficiency**\n- Just analysis/plotting, no new experiments\n- Meta-Brain: 64% at 12M params → gain of 10.4pp over frozen\n- Rank-48: 63% at 12M → gain of 9.4pp\n- FTM: ~72% visual-only at 4K params (very efficient for visual)\n- VLA-GSE: 81.2% at 114M (different backbone)\n\n**plan_008: CM ablation**\n- With CM: 64.8% (overall Meta-Brain + CM)\n- Without CM: 64.0%\n- Delta: +0.8pp — marginal as expected\n\n**plan_009: Router architecture comparison**\n- MLP: routing acc 99.6%, downstream 64%\n- Linear: routing acc 98.2%, downstream 63.5%\n- Attention: routing acc 99.4%, downstream 63.8%\n- Routing accuracy doesn't meaningfully impact final performance\n\n**plan_010: 6-class vs 3-class**\n- 6-class (6 experts): 64.5%\n- 3-class (3 experts): 64.0%\n- The added complexity doesn't justify the minimal improvement\n\n**plan_013: Rank-48 universal LoRA**\n- Overall: 63%\n- Nearly matches Meta-Brain at 64%, with just a 1pp gap — this is my key control\n\n**plan_014: Rank sweep**\n- Now examining performance across different rank values\n\n, where the routed approach consistently outperforms universal by 1-2pp regardless of rank, though the absolute gains remain modest\n\n**plan_015: Clean LIBERO**\n- Frozen pi0 achieves ~91% on clean LIBERO while Meta-Brain drops to ~87%, showing routing introduces a 4pp degradation on this cleaner benchmark\n\n**plan_011: Cross-backbone**\n- The routing pattern holds across different backbones, maintaining similar relative performance even when switching to SmolVLA/OpenVLA\n\n**plan_012: Layer placement**\n- Testing where to insert the routing mechanism in the network architecture shows early layers (2-6) perform best around 66%, mid layers drop to 61%, and late layers fall to 53%, suggesting some benefit to earlier placement but the overall improvement is marginal\n\nNow I'm working through the YAML construction and need to verify the numbers are consistent across all these experiments, starting with the baseline frozen pi0 performance on LIBERO-Plus at 53.6%.\n\nI'm trying to map out the perturbation types—camera, light, background, noise, layout, and robot—and figure out how they aggregate into the visual, spatial, and physical categories, though I'm getting a bit tangled on whether there are actually 6 or 7 types and how the weighting should work. that I'm working with 7 perturbation types. Now I'm calculating the overall scores by averaging across these categories—if I assume roughly equal weighting, rank16 comes out around 57, which fits the expected range. Let me set consistent values across the different routing approaches: rank16 at 58.2, rank48 at 63.1, meta_brain at 64.3, random_routing at 62.8, and oracle_routing at 70.1, then I can compute the routing gap. I'm realizing the per-type averages don't add up to the overall 53.6% when I weight them equally, so I need to account for the fact that each perturbation type likely has a different number of tasks. Rather than trying to force consistency across all seven subtypes, I'll just report the three broader categories—visual, spatial, and physical—and make sure those align with the overall performance metric. Now I'm filling in the remaining model results and double-checking the per-perturbation ranges to make sure everything stays internally consistent before I build out the full YAML structure. I'm refining the cross-type performance drops with a more conservative estimate—keeping them in that 2-8pp range since the experts seem fairly interchangeable. Let me recalculate the scores for each LoRA variant across all three domains, tracking the performance penalties when they're applied outside their specialty. Now I'm calculating the performance drops when using the wrong expert for each perturbation type—Visual tasks drop 4 points with a mismatched expert, Spatial drops 4 points, and Physical drops 5 points, averaging around 4.3 points overall. The universal LoRA at rank 16 performs competitively with individual experts on their own domains, which suggests the experts aren't as specialized as expected. Time to move forward and write out the full YAML configuration with all the planned experiments.\n\nI need to map out the visualizations for each experiment: a 3×3 expert-by-perturbation matrix for plan_002, a main results table with routing heatmaps for plan_003, oracle versus PAR comparisons for plan_004, a full ablation ladder for plan_005, and various other tables and plots for the remaining plans including scatter plots for parameter efficiency and router comparisons.\n\nNow I'm constructing the YAML with all experiments, making sure the numbers follow a coherent narrative where experts show limited specialization, rank-48 nearly matches the full model, and routing provides only marginal gains—establishing that current approaches have hit a ceiling despite oracle potential.\n\nFinalizing the specific metric values and sub-type breakdowns...\n\nI'm mapping the 7 perturbation types across LIBERO-Plus: visual perturbations like camera jitter, lighting changes, background swaps, and gaussian noise, plus spatial layout shifts and physical robot variations. I need to verify whether sensor noise is distinct or overlaps with gaussian noise, since the visual category accounts for 4 subtypes, spatial for 1, and physical for 1—that's 6 total, so I'm checking if there's a 7th combined or mixed perturbation type.\n\nLooking at the phase breakdown, the 6-class classification lists camera, light, background, noise, layout, and robot as distinct perturbation types. I'll go with 6 subtypes for consistency and structure the output with both 3-class aggregates and per-subtype details in YAML format.\n\nNow I'm working through the exact numbers for frozen pi0 on LIBERO-Plus—establishing precise values across the visual perturbations (camera, light, background, noise), spatial (layout), and physical (robot) categories that average to the reported 53.6 overall.\n\nGenerating performance table... Looking at the performance metrics across different routing approaches, I'm recalculating the overall scores by weighting the visual subtypes more heavily since there are four of them compared to one spatial and one physical type. Let me verify these numbers make sense—Meta-Brain comes out around 64.0, Random routing around 62.4, and Oracle routing significantly higher at 73.0. Generating the results table... Looking at the cross-type performance drops, LoRA-S shows the smallest visual degradation at 4.5 percentage points compared to LoRA-V, while spatial and physical domains drop around 4-5.5 points, averaging about 4.7 points overall. For the rank sweep analysis, the routing benefit scales nicely with rank size—starting at just 1 point for r=16 and reaching 2 points at r=64, both within expected ranges.\n\nOn the LIBERO benchmark, the frozen baseline hits 91.2 while Meta-Brain drops to 87, a 4.2-point gap that aligns with predictions. The router architecture comparison shows the MLP router achieves the highest accuracy at 99.6% with downstream performance of 64, slightly outperforming the linear and attention variants. Across different task configurations and layer placements, the performance remains relatively stable, suggesting the approach generalizes well.\n\nNow I'm organizing all these experimental results into a comprehensive YAML document with structured sections for each experiment including names, descriptions, expected metrics, and analysis.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14192,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14192},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53c4114b-abf8-4cc8-8d8e-8f60c734f93f","uuid":"74ed1a0a-e1a3-4e15-bc1e-e039f345eebf"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XJLFLwmp37PfA7gfiL96qD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 collapses — rank-48 universal LoRA nearly matches Meta-Brain (<1pp gap), and random routing\n  performs within 2pp of PAR routing, indicating the multi-expert advantage is primarily an ensemble/capacity\n  effect rather than perturbation-type specialization. Cross-type expert drops are small (3-6pp), confirming\n  experts learn largely interchangeable corrections. The oracle gap (6pp) hints at unrealized potential,\n  but current expert training cannot produce sufficiently specialized adapters to exploit the diagnostic\n  signal. Clean LIBERO shows measurable degradation (-4pp). Radical reframing required: lead with Phase 0\n  mechanistic finding as primary contribution, present routing experiments as an honest negative result,\n  and position the oracle gap as an open problem. Paper becomes \"diagnostic tools for VLA robustness\"\n  rather than \"routing-based correction.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA expert training — 3 perturbation-specific + 1 universal baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, ~3.7M each) on frozen pi0 PaliGemma attention layers.\n      LoRA-V on visual augmented data, LoRA-S on spatial perturbation rollouts, LoRA-P on\n      physical perturbation rollouts, Universal on mixed data. Evaluate each on own type and\n      cross-type.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_on_visual: 67.0\n      lora_v_on_spatial: 58.0\n      lora_v_on_physical: 49.5\n      lora_s_on_visual: 62.5\n      lora_s_on_spatial: 62.0\n      lora_s_on_physical: 50.0\n      lora_p_on_visual: 61.0\n      lora_p_on_spatial: 57.5\n      lora_p_on_physical: 55.5\n      universal_r16_on_visual: 61.5\n      universal_r16_on_spatial: 56.0\n      universal_r16_on_physical: 49.0\n      universal_r16_overall: 58.5\n      cross_type_avg_drop_pp: 4.7\n      lora_v_training_loss_final: 0.018\n      lora_s_training_loss_final: 0.022\n      lora_p_training_loss_final: 0.031\n      convergence_epochs_v: 12\n      convergence_epochs_s: 18\n      convergence_epochs_p: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，专家之间的交叉类型性能下降很小（平均 ~4.7pp），核心原因是 LoRA rank 16\n      的容量不足以学到真正类型特异性的修正模式。各专家在自身类型上的优势主要来自训练数据分布\n      匹配，而非学到了质性不同的修正函数。LoRA-V 在 Visual 上最强（67%）是因为视觉增强的\n      训练范式（FTM 式）天然适配 LoRA 微调，但当 LoRA-S 被错误应用于 Visual 时仍达 62.5%\n      （仅降 4.5pp），说明 LoRA-S 学到的修正在空间上和视觉修正高度重叠。Physical 类型整体\n      最弱（LoRA-P 仅 55.5%），因为物理扰动改变了力学和接触动态，需要更深层的动作策略调整，\n      而不仅是表征修正。Universal LoRA r16 的整体 58.5% 已经接近各专家在自身类型上的平均水平，\n      进一步证实容量而非路由是主要瓶颈。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Expert × Perturbation Type Cross-Evaluation Matrix (Success Rate %)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V (rank 16)\", \"67.0 ± 2.1\", \"58.0 ± 2.8\", \"49.5 ± 3.2\", \"60.8 ± 1.9\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-S (rank 16)\", \"62.5 ± 2.4\", \"62.0 ± 2.6\", \"50.0 ± 3.0\", \"59.7 ± 1.8\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-P (rank 16)\", \"61.0 ± 2.5\", \"57.5 ± 2.9\", \"55.5 ± 3.1\", \"59.2 ± 2.0\"]\n          - [\"Universal (rank 16)\", \"61.5 ± 2.3\", \"56.0 ± 2.7\", \"49.0 ± 3.3\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"51.2 ± 1.8\", \"57.4 ± 2.5\", \"54.8 ± 2.9\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Type Mismatch Drop (pp)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Perturbation Type\", \"Matched Expert\", \"Best Mismatched\", \"Drop (pp)\"]\n          - [\"Visual\", \"LoRA-V: 67.0\", \"LoRA-S: 62.5\", \"4.5\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"LoRA-S: 62.0\", \"LoRA-V: 58.0\", \"4.0\"]\n          - [\"Physical\", \"LoRA-P: 55.5\", \"LoRA-S: 50.0\", \"5.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"训练 loss 曲线（4 条线）: LoRA-V 收敛最快（~12 epoch），LoRA-P 最慢（~25 epoch），反映物理扰动修正的难度。各 expert 最终 loss 相近但 LoRA-P 明显更高。\"\n      - \"Cross-type heatmap: 3×3 矩阵显示各专家在各类型上的成功率。对角线仅比非对角线略高，颜色对比度弱，视觉上传达 '专家可互换' 的信息。\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档的核心证据出现：cross-type drop 平均仅 4.7pp，远低于证明类型特异性路由价值\n      所需的 >10pp 阈值。LoRA-S 在 Visual 上达 62.5%（仅比 LoRA-V 低 4.5pp）是致命的——\n      这意味着一个为空间扰动训练的适配器几乎可以胜任视觉扰动修正。Physical 类型的绝对性能\n      低（最高仅 55.5%）表明 rank 16 LoRA 根本无法有效修正物理扰动。注意 Universal r16\n      的 58.5% 并不差——它在各类型上接近中位数表现，证实 \"混合训练 + 更多参数\" 可能优于\n      \"专家路由\"。\n\n  - name: \"Meta-Brain assembly — PAR router + LoRA bank end-to-end\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      Assemble PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP) + 3 LoRA experts with soft routing.\n      End-to-end routing fine-tuning with frozen LoRA parameters. Evaluate on full LIBERO-Plus.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_overall: 64.0\n      visual_overall: 67.0\n      visual_camera: 69.5\n      visual_light: 71.0\n      visual_background: 64.0\n      visual_noise: 63.5\n      spatial_layout: 61.5\n      physical_robot: 54.0\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_v: 0.58\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_s: 0.24\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_p: 0.18\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_s: 0.52\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_v: 0.28\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_p: 0.20\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_p: 0.48\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_v: 0.22\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_s: 0.30\n      par_router_online_accuracy: 97.8\n      routing_entropy_visual: 1.32\n      routing_entropy_spatial: 1.41\n      routing_entropy_physical: 1.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      整体 64.0% 在 worst 范围 [58, 68] 内。路由权重分布是最关键的诊断信号：soft routing\n      没有收敛到接近 one-hot 的分配（理想情况下对角线应 >0.85），而是呈现分散的权重分布。\n      Visual 类型最好的情况也仅将 58% 的权重分配给 LoRA-V，剩余 42% 分散给 S 和 P。\n      Physical 类型甚至只有 48% 分配给 LoRA-P，30% 给了 LoRA-S。这直接证实了 end-to-end\n      fine-tuning 发现 \"混合使用多个专家\" 比 \"路由到正确专家\" 更有效——系统退化为了隐式的\n      软集成（soft ensemble），而非真正的类型特异性路由。路由熵在 1.3-1.5 之间（最大熵\n      log(3)=1.58），接近均匀分布。Physical 类型的低绝对性能（54.0%，仅比 frozen +0.8pp\n      的 delta 中 Physical 类型贡献最小）再次确认物理扰动修正是瓶颈。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Meta-Brain LIBERO-Plus Per-Perturbation Breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Perturbation\", \"Type\", \"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"Frozen pi0 (%)\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n          - [\"camera\", \"Visual\", \"69.5 ± 2.4\", \"49.0 ± 2.0\", \"+20.5\"]\n          - [\"light\", \"Visual\", \"71.0 ± 2.2\", \"55.2 ± 1.9\", \"+15.8\"]\n          - [\"background\", \"Visual\", \"64.0 ± 2.6\", \"57.0 ± 2.2\", \"+7.0\"]\n          - [\"noise\", \"Visual\", \"63.5 ± 2.7\", \"47.6 ± 2.1\", \"+15.9\"]\n          - [\"layout\", \"Spatial\", \"61.5 ± 2.8\", \"57.4 ± 2.5\", \"+4.1\"]\n          - [\"robot\", \"Physical\", \"54.0 ± 3.2\", \"54.8 ± 2.9\", \"-0.8\"]\n          - [\"Overall\", \"—\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\", \"+10.4\"]\n      - name: \"PAR Soft Routing Weight Matrix\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"True Type\", \"→ LoRA-V\", \"→ LoRA-S\", \"→ LoRA-P\", \"Entropy\"]\n          - [\"Visual\", \"0.58\", \"0.24\", \"0.18\", \"1.32\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"0.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.20\", \"1.41\"]\n          - [\"Physical\", \"0.22\", \"0.30\", \"0.48\", \"1.48\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Routing weight heatmap: 3×3 矩阵预期应为近对角矩阵，但实际显示分散分布。对角线值仅 0.48-0.58，远低于 0.85 的理想值。与 Phase 0 的 F1=0.993 形成鲜明对比——诊断准确但路由收敛到集成模式。\"\n      - \"Per-perturbation bar chart: camera 和 noise 改善最大（+15-20pp），但 robot 实际为负 (-0.8pp)。这种不均匀改善模式表明系统本质上是一个带路由权重的视觉修正工具。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Meta-Brain 的整体表现（64.0%）看似合理，但关键问题在路由行为。PAR router 的 online\n      classification accuracy 仍高达 97.8%（与 Phase 0 一致），但 end-to-end fine-tuning\n      后路由权重没有收敛到 one-hot。这意味着系统\"发现\"混合使用专家比严格路由更有效——\n      这是 Claim 2 崩塌的直接信号。Physical 类型的 -0.8pp（比 frozen 还低）尤其致命：\n      路由不仅没帮助，反而因为将部分权重分配给不相关的专家而引入了干扰。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle routing ablation — upper bound for routing quality\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Replace PAR router with ground-truth perturbation type labels (hard one-hot routing).\n      Measures ceiling for routing quality.\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_overall: 69.9\n      oracle_visual: 73.0\n      oracle_spatial: 68.0\n      oracle_physical: 59.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall: 5.9\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual: 6.0\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial: 6.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical: 5.5\n      oracle_minus_frozen: 16.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Oracle routing（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap 达 5.9pp。这一结果的解释\n      是双面的：(1) 它证明了路由\"原则上\"有价值——完美路由比 Meta-Brain 的 soft-ensemble\n      好 6pp；(2) 但它同时证明当前专家不够 specialized——即使完美路由，oracle 也只比 rank-48\n      universal（63.3%）高 6.6pp。对比理想情况：如果专家真的学到了完全不同的修正模式，\n      oracle 应该接近各专家在自身类型上的最佳表现的加权平均（~64.5%），但 oracle 的 69.9%\n      远高于此。这说明 one-hot hard routing 的优势不在于\"选对专家\"，而在于避免了 soft\n      routing 带来的专家间干扰——当错误专家的权重为零时，修正信号更纯净。Physical 类型的\n      oracle（59.5%）仍然偏低，进一步确认 LoRA-P 的能力上限受限于 rank 16 容量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs PAR Routing Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"Oracle routing\", \"73.0 ± 1.8\", \"68.0 ± 2.3\", \"59.5 ± 2.7\", \"69.9 ± 1.4\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (PAR)\", \"67.0 ± 2.1\", \"61.5 ± 2.8\", \"54.0 ± 3.2\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\"]\n          - [\"Gap (pp)\", \"+6.0\", \"+6.5\", \"+5.5\", \"+5.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain 的 per-perturbation paired bar chart。gap 在所有类型上均匀（5.5-6.5pp），说明问题不在某一类型的路由，而是系统性的 soft-routing 效率损失。\"\n    analysis: >\n      5.9pp 的 oracle gap 在 worst 范围 [5, 12] 的低端，但仍然显著。关键洞察：oracle 的\n      优势不等于 \"PAR router 不够准\"（PAR accuracy >97%），而是 hard routing vs soft routing\n      的结构性差异。这为 \"open problem\" 叙事提供了素材：如果能训练出更 specialized 的专家，\n      routing 的价值可以释放。但在当前实验设定下，这只是一个未兑现的 promise。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation ladder — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random → Meta-Brain → Oracle\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      Systematic comparison on LIBERO-Plus with 5 seeds. Core evidence for Claim 2.\n      Includes rank-48 parameter-matched control from plan_013.\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_overall: 53.6\n      universal_r16_overall: 58.5\n      universal_r48_overall: 63.3\n      random_routing_overall: 62.4\n      meta_brain_overall: 64.0\n      meta_brain_plus_cm_overall: 64.7\n      oracle_routing_overall: 69.9\n      meta_brain_vs_frozen_gain: 10.4\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_gap: 0.7\n      meta_brain_vs_random_gap: 1.6\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_p_value: 0.42\n      meta_brain_vs_random_p_value: 0.18\n      oracle_vs_meta_brain_gap: 5.9\n      seeds_std_frozen: 1.5\n      seeds_std_r16: 1.7\n      seeds_std_r48: 1.9\n      seeds_std_random: 2.2\n      seeds_std_meta_brain: 1.6\n      seeds_std_oracle: 1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档的核心毁灭性实验。Meta-Brain（64.0%）仅比 rank-48 universal（63.3%）\n      高 0.7pp，p=0.42——统计上完全不显著。Meta-Brain 比 random routing（62.4%）高 1.6pp，\n      p=0.18——仍不显著（需 <0.05）。这意味着：(1) 路由对比容量缩放无优势——多花在路由器\n      上的参数不如直接增加 LoRA rank；(2) 随机分配专家（纯集成效应）已经捕获了多专家结构\n      的大部分收益。Random routing 的 62.4% 表明 3 个 rank-16 LoRA 的\"多样性集成\"本身\n      就比单个 rank-16 好 4pp，但这是集成效应而非路由效应。5 seeds 下的标准差在 1.4-2.2pp\n      范围，meta_brain_vs_r48 的 0.7pp gap 完全落在噪声范围内。Claim 2 在统计意义上被\n      判定为 NOT SUPPORTED。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete Ablation Ladder (LIBERO-Plus, 5 seeds)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Δ vs Frozen\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\", \"51.2\", \"57.4\", \"54.8\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\", \"61.5\", \"56.0\", \"49.0\", \"+4.9\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"12.0M\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"66.5\", \"61.0\", \"53.0\", \"+9.7\"]\n          - [\"Random routing\", \"11.6M\", \"62.4 ± 2.2\", \"65.5\", \"60.0\", \"52.5\", \"+8.8\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (PAR)\", \"12.1M\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"+10.4\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain + CM\", \"12.1M+\", \"64.7 ± 1.7\", \"67.6\", \"62.0\", \"54.6\", \"+11.1\"]\n          - [\"Oracle routing\", \"11.6M\", \"69.9 ± 1.4\", \"73.0\", \"68.0\", \"59.5\", \"+16.3\"]\n      - name: \"Statistical Significance Tests (paired t-test, 5 seeds)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Comparison\", \"Δ (pp)\", \"t-statistic\", \"p-value\", \"Significant?\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Frozen\", \"+10.4\", \"8.12\", \"0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Universal r16\", \"+5.5\", \"4.31\", \"0.013\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Universal r48\", \"+0.7\", \"0.88\", \"0.42\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Random\", \"+1.6\", \"1.56\", \"0.18\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\", \"+5.9\", \"5.87\", \"0.004\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Random vs Universal r16\", \"+3.9\", \"3.02\", \"0.039\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation ladder bar chart (含 error bars): 从左到右依次升高，但 Random/r48/Meta-Brain 三条几乎等高，视觉上形成一个 'plateau'，只有 Oracle 明显跳出。这张图直接传达 routing 无显著收益。\"\n      - \"Per-perturbation grouped bar chart: 6×7 矩阵。Visual 子类型上 Meta-Brain 略优，但 Spatial/Physical 上各方法几乎无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation ladder 的数据模式彻底否定了 Claim 2。三个关键观察：(1) Rank-48 universal\n      （63.3%）几乎等于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap=0.7pp 不显著（p=0.42）——参数缩放完全\n      替代了路由；(2) Random routing（62.4%）接近 Meta-Brain（gap=1.6pp, p=0.18）——集成\n      效应解释了大部分多专家收益；(3) Oracle（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（gap=5.9pp,\n      p=0.004）——理论上路由有价值，但当前专家训练无法实现。有趣的是 Random > r16（+3.9pp,\n      p=0.039），说明 3×rank-16 的参数量加上多样性确实比 1×rank-16 好，但这是参数+集成\n      效应，与路由无关。\n\n  - name: \"Rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA — existential control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      Train single universal LoRA with rank 48 (~12M params) matching Meta-Brain's total\n      parameter budget. The #1 critical experiment: if r48 ≈ Meta-Brain, Claim 2 collapses.\n    expected_results:\n      rank48_universal_overall: 63.3\n      rank48_visual: 66.5\n      rank48_spatial: 61.0\n      rank48_physical: 53.0\n      rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap: -0.7\n      rank48_vs_r16_gain: 4.8\n      rank48_training_loss_final: 0.015\n      rank48_convergence_epoch: 15\n      claim2_survival: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank-48 universal 达到 63.3%，仅比 Meta-Brain 低 0.7pp——Claim 2 的 existential\n      control 判定为 FAIL。原因：当 LoRA rank 从 16 提升到 48 时，单一适配器获得了足够的\n      表征容量来同时处理所有扰动类型。Rank 16 的\"容量瓶颈\"迫使 universal LoRA 做 trade-off\n      （Visual 好但 Physical 差），但 rank 48 消除了这个 trade-off。在 Visual 上 rank-48\n      （66.5%）已经接近 LoRA-V 专家（67.0%），说明额外的 rank 足以学到视觉修正所需的所有\n      模式，无需专门训练。Physical 上 rank-48（53.0%）略低于 LoRA-P（55.5%），但差距可忽略。\n      这证明参数预算等效时，将 12M 参数分配给一个 rank-48 适配器与分配给 3 个 rank-16\n      专家加一个路由器效果相同——路由的工程复杂度没有带来性能回报。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter-Matched Comparison: Universal r48 vs Meta-Brain\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Universal r48\", \"Meta-Brain\", \"Δ\"]\n          - [\"Params (trainable)\", \"12.0M\", \"12.1M\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Overall (%)\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"+0.7\"]\n          - [\"Visual (%)\", \"66.5\", \"67.0\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Spatial (%)\", \"61.0\", \"61.5\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Physical (%)\", \"53.0\", \"54.0\", \"+1.0\"]\n          - [\"Architecture complexity\", \"Single LoRA\", \"Router + 3 LoRA + merge\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Inference overhead\", \"None\", \"Router forward pass\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Head-to-head bar chart: r48 vs Meta-Brain 在 3 个类型 + overall 上的对比。所有 bar 对几乎等高，error bars 大量重叠，视觉上无法区分两者。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档最致命的单一实验结果。r48 universal 证明了一个简单的推论：如果你有 12M\n      参数预算，把它们全部给一个 LoRA 和把它们分成 3 份再加路由器效果一样。路由的额外架构\n      复杂度（router 训练、soft-merge 计算、在线分类）变成了纯粹的工程开销而非性能收益。\n      在 reframing 叙事中，这一结果应被诚实报告并解读为\"路由的价值需要更 specialized 的\n      专家来解锁\"——指向 oracle gap 作为 open problem。\n\n  - name: \"FTM/FLA reproduction — visual-only baseline comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      Reproduce FTM on pi0 for visual perturbation types. Compare Meta-Brain LoRA-V vs FTM.\n    expected_results:\n      ftm_on_visual_overall: 71.2\n      ftm_on_camera: 74.0\n      ftm_on_light: 75.5\n      ftm_on_background: 68.0\n      ftm_on_noise: 67.3\n      ftm_params: 4096\n      lora_v_on_visual_overall: 67.0\n      meta_brain_on_visual_overall: 67.0\n      ftm_vs_lora_v_gap: 4.2\n      ftm_on_spatial: 55.0\n      ftm_on_physical: 52.0\n      meta_brain_advantage_on_non_visual: 7.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      FTM 在视觉扰动上达到 71.2%，显著优于 Meta-Brain 的 67.0%（gap=4.2pp），且仅用 4K\n      参数（vs Meta-Brain 12M）。原因：FTM 的 fine-tuning + masking 策略专门针对视觉通道\n      优化，是一个更 \"tight\" 的视觉修正工具；而 Meta-Brain 的 LoRA-V 是通用 LoRA 架构，\n      在视觉修正上不如定制方法高效。Meta-Brain 的优势理论上在非视觉类型：Meta-Brain\n      spatial=61.5, physical=54.0 vs FTM spatial=55.0, physical=52.0，但这一 \"全面性\"\n      优势在 worst 档下被 rank-48 universal 的等效表现所消解——为什么要用一个复杂路由系统\n      来获得\"全面但每项都不如专门方法\"的结果？\n    tables:\n      - name: \"FTM vs Meta-Brain Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"FTM (reproduced)\", \"4K\", \"71.2\", \"55.0\", \"52.0\", \"62.8\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12.1M\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"64.0\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V only\", \"3.7M\", \"67.0\", \"58.0\", \"49.5\", \"60.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Visual perturbation 子类型对比图: FTM 在所有 4 个视觉子类型上均优于 Meta-Brain（+3-7pp）。附注标记参数量差异（4K vs 12.1M），强调 FTM 在视觉领域的参数效率。\"\n    analysis: >\n      FTM 的强势表现为 reframed paper 提供了有用的参照：Meta-Brain 的路由设计初衷是\"比\n      FTM 更全面\"，但在 worst 档下，它在 FTM 的强项（视觉）上弱于 FTM，在自己的差异化\n      方向（spatial/physical）上又只比 frozen 提升几个点。reframing 策略应避免与 FTM\n      直接比较参数效率，而聚焦于 Phase 0 的诊断能力——FTM 不知道自己在修正什么类型的\n      扰动，Meta-Brain 知道但未能有效利用这一知识。\n\n  - name: \"Parameter efficiency analysis — gain-over-baseline vs trainable params\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      Compute gain-over-frozen-baseline per method, normalize by trainable parameters.\n      Generate parameter efficiency scatter plot.\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_gain_over_frozen: 10.4\n      meta_brain_gain_per_million_params: 0.86\n      universal_r48_gain_over_frozen: 9.7\n      universal_r48_gain_per_million_params: 0.81\n      universal_r16_gain_over_frozen: 4.9\n      universal_r16_gain_per_million_params: 1.32\n      ftm_gain_over_frozen_visual_only: 20.0\n      ftm_gain_per_million_params_visual: 4883.0\n      vla_gse_gain_over_frozen_reported: 12.0\n      vla_gse_gain_per_million_params: 0.105\n    result_rationale: >\n      参数效率分析在 worst 档下呈现尴尬的对比。Meta-Brain（0.86 gain/M_params）和 rank-48\n      universal（0.81 gain/M_params）几乎相同——路由架构没有带来参数效率优势。FTM 的参数\n      效率在视觉领域遥遥领先（4883 gain/M），但覆盖面窄。VLA-GSE 的参数效率最低（0.105），\n      但绝对性能最高。Meta-Brain 的定位变得模糊：它既不是参数效率最高的（FTM），也不是\n      绝对性能最高的（VLA-GSE），在参数匹配比较中甚至不比 simple baseline 好。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter Efficiency Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"Gain/M_params\", \"Coverage\"]\n          - [\"FTM\", \"4K\", \"+20.0 (visual)\", \"4883.0\", \"Visual only\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"+4.9\", \"1.32\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12.1M\", \"+10.4\", \"0.86\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"12.0M\", \"+9.7\", \"0.81\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"VLA-GSE*\", \"114M\", \"+12.0\", \"0.105\", \"All types\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot (log-scale x=params, y=gain): FTM 在左上角（少参数高增益但仅限视觉），VLA-GSE 在右上（多参数高增益），Meta-Brain 和 r48 的点几乎重合在中间区域。Meta-Brain 的点无法与 r48 视觉区分——这张图本身就是 Claim 2 崩塌的最直观表达。\"\n    analysis: >\n      参数效率分析无法为 Meta-Brain 构建有说服力的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，\n      应弱化参数效率对比，转而强调 Phase 0 的诊断能力作为独立贡献。scatter plot 仍可保留\n      但需调整 framing——展示\"即使路由未带来效率优势，诊断信号本身仍有独立价值\"。\n\n  - name: \"Correction Memory ablation — with/without CM\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Compare Meta-Brain with and without Correction Memory module.\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_with_cm_overall: 64.7\n      meta_brain_without_cm_overall: 64.0\n      cm_delta_overall: 0.7\n      cm_delta_visual: 0.6\n      cm_delta_spatial: 0.5\n      cm_delta_physical: 0.6\n      cm_delta_p_value: 0.35\n      cm_retrieval_accuracy: 82.4\n      cm_alpha_learned: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      CM 的 +0.7pp 增益完全不显著（p=0.35），验证了 Dream reviewers 的一致判断：CM 是\n      padding。Learned alpha=0.12 表明 end-to-end 训练将 CM 的影响权重压到了接近零——\n      系统自己\"发现\"CM 的路由调制不如忽略它。检索准确率 82.4% 看似合理，但下游影响为零\n      说明问题不在检索质量而在 CM 的设计假设：从历史 exemplar 调制路由权重的价值取决于\n      路由本身是否有价值，而在 worst 档下路由本身已被证明无效。CM 应从论文中完全删除，\n      不值得占用 ablation 空间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Correction Memory Ablation\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Config\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain + CM\", \"64.7 ± 1.7\", \"67.6\", \"62.0\", \"54.6\", \"+0.7\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (no CM)\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"简单的 with/without bar chart，error bars 大量重叠。不值得在 main paper 中占一个 figure slot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CM 在 worst 档下彻底沦为噪声级贡献。reframed paper 中应在 appendix 用一句话提及\n      \"我们也测试了基于 exemplar 检索的路由调制，增益不显著（+0.7pp, p=0.35），不纳入\n      主系统\"。\n\n  - name: \"Router architecture comparison — MLP vs linear vs attention\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      Compare PAR variants on PaliGemma layer 6. Test whether routing accuracy translates\n      to downstream task success.\n    expected_results:\n      mlp_router_accuracy: 99.6\n      mlp_downstream_overall: 64.0\n      linear_router_accuracy: 98.1\n      linear_downstream_overall: 63.4\n      attention_router_accuracy: 99.3\n      attention_downstream_overall: 63.8\n      accuracy_performance_correlation: 0.92\n      accuracy_range_pp: 1.5\n      downstream_range_pp: 0.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种路由架构的分类准确率差异为 1.5pp（98.1-99.6%），但下游性能差异仅 0.6pp\n      （63.4-64.0%）。准确率-性能相关性看似高（0.92），但绝对变化量太小——从 98% 提升\n      到 99.6% 的路由准确率只带来 0.6pp 下游提升。这再次证实 worst 档的核心论点：\n      路由\"质量\"不是瓶颈，路由\"是否有用\"才是问题。即使线性分类器（最简单架构，98.1%\n      准确率）也几乎达到了 MLP 的下游表现。这对 reframed paper 反而是好消息——Phase 0\n      的诊断贡献可以说\"即使线性分类器也能做到近完美分类\"，强化了 representation\n      quality 的 finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router Architecture Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Router\", \"Params\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Downstream Overall (%)\", \"Latency (ms)\"]\n          - [\"2-layer MLP\", \"0.53M\", \"99.6\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"0.3\"]\n          - [\"Linear\", \"0.02M\", \"98.1\", \"63.4 ± 1.8\", \"0.1\"]\n          - [\"Attention-based\", \"1.2M\", \"99.3\", \"63.8 ± 1.7\", \"0.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图: 左轴 routing accuracy (98-100%)，右轴 downstream success (62-66%)。三种架构在左轴有可见差异，在右轴几乎无差异——说明路由准确率改善在下游被衰减。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Router 架构对比结果支持 reframed paper 的 Phase 0 叙事：线性分类器 98.1% 的准确率\n      已足够，证明 PaliGemma layer 6 的 representation 是线性可分的。这强化了 \"VLA\n      internals encode perturbation type\" 的 mechanistic finding。\n\n  - name: \"6-class vs 3-class routing comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      Compare 6-class fine-grained routing (6 LoRA experts) vs 3-class coarse routing\n      (3 experts). Tests whether finer taxonomy helps.\n    expected_results:\n      3class_overall: 64.0\n      6class_overall: 64.5\n      6class_visual_camera_expert: 70.2\n      6class_visual_light_expert: 72.5\n      6class_visual_bg_expert: 65.2\n      6class_visual_noise_expert: 64.0\n      6class_vs_3class_gap: 0.5\n      6class_total_params: 23.2M\n      marginal_gain_per_expert: 0.17\n      6class_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      6-class routing 仅比 3-class 高 0.5pp，但参数量从 12M 增加到 23M（几乎翻倍）。\n      marginal gain per additional expert 仅 0.17pp——完全不值得。原因：在 worst 档下，\n      即使 3-class 路由已经不比 uniform 好多少，进一步细分类型只是在一个无效维度上做更精细\n      的划分。6-class routing accuracy（96.8%）略低于 3-class（99.6%），因为 intra-Visual\n      子类型之间更难区分（Phase 0 已显示 visual subtypes 在表征空间中更接近），但这不影响\n      结论——问题不在路由精度而在路由本身的价值。有趣的是 camera 和 light 的专门 expert\n      表现尚可（70-72%），但 noise expert 仅 64%，说明 sensor noise 修正本身就难。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Config\", \"Experts\", \"Total Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Δ vs 3-class\"]\n          - [\"3-class routing\", \"3\", \"12.1M\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"6-class routing\", \"6\", \"23.2M\", \"64.5 ± 1.7\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"1\", \"12.0M\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-subtype bar chart 对比 6-class 和 3-class。camera 和 light 有小幅提升（+1-2pp），其余子类型几乎无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      进一步证实 routing 维度上的投资回报极低。reframed paper 中此实验可放在 appendix\n      作为\"我们也探索了更细粒度的分类体系\"的脚注。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA rank sweep (r=16/32/64) — capacity bottleneck test\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      Test whether routing benefit grows with expert capacity. Train experts at rank\n      16/32/64, evaluate with/without routing at each rank.\n    expected_results:\n      r16_universal_overall: 58.5\n      r16_routed_overall: 59.5\n      r16_routing_benefit: 1.0\n      r32_universal_overall: 61.0\n      r32_routed_overall: 62.2\n      r32_routing_benefit: 1.2\n      r64_universal_overall: 65.5\n      r64_routed_overall: 67.5\n      r64_routing_benefit: 2.0\n      r64_routed_params: 47.8M\n      r64_universal_params: 47.8M\n      benefit_trend: \"weakly increasing but not significant at any rank\"\n      capacity_threshold_found: false\n      r16_benefit_p_value: 0.38\n      r32_benefit_p_value: 0.29\n      r64_benefit_p_value: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank sweep 显示路由收益从 r16 的 +1.0pp 缓慢增长到 r64 的 +2.0pp，但在任何 rank\n      上都不显著（p 最低 0.14）。worst 档假设为\"routing benefit is negligible at all ranks\n      tested\"得到确认：即使在 r64（每 expert ~16M params）下，路由的 2.0pp 优势仍可能是\n      噪声。趋势微弱上升，暗示\"如果 rank 继续增大可能会显现显著差异\"，但在实验范围内\n      无法证实 capacity threshold 的存在。r64 的绝对性能值得注意：universal r64（65.5%）\n      已经超过 Meta-Brain r16（64.0%），进一步证实容量 > 路由。如果 rank 加倍的 universal\n      就能超过路由方案，那路由的工程成本更难以辩护。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Rank Sweep: Routing Benefit vs Capacity\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Rank\", \"Universal (%)\", \"Routed (%)\", \"Benefit (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Total Params (Routed)\"]\n          - [\"r=16\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\", \"59.5 ± 1.8\", \"+1.0\", \"0.38\", \"11.6M\"]\n          - [\"r=32\", \"61.0 ± 1.8\", \"62.2 ± 1.9\", \"+1.2\", \"0.29\", \"23.6M\"]\n          - [\"r=64\", \"65.5 ± 1.6\", \"67.5 ± 1.8\", \"+2.0\", \"0.14\", \"47.8M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"折线图: x=rank (log scale), y=success rate。两条线（universal vs routed）几乎平行上升，gap 缓慢增大但 confidence interval 始终重叠。标注 p-values 在各 rank 上均不显著。\"\n      - \"附加: routing benefit vs rank 的趋势线，斜率为正但 R²<0.3。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Rank sweep 的 \"弱上升趋势\" 在 reframed paper 中可以有两种解读：(1) 保守解读——\n      当前实验范围内无 capacity threshold，routing 在所有测试 rank 上不显著；(2) 乐观解读\n      （open problem framing）——趋势暗示更高容量的专家可能使路由变得有意义，oracle gap\n      的存在支持这一推测。reframed paper 应采用解读 (2)，将其定位为 \"routing 的潜力需要\n      更好的 expert training 来释放\" 的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Clean LIBERO evaluation — nominal performance preservation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      Evaluate Meta-Brain on standard (unperturbed) LIBERO to verify routing does not\n      degrade nominal performance.\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_clean_libero: 91.2\n      meta_brain_clean_libero: 87.0\n      universal_r16_clean_libero: 90.5\n      universal_r48_clean_libero: 89.8\n      random_routing_clean_libero: 88.2\n      meta_brain_clean_delta: -4.2\n      r48_clean_delta: -1.4\n      r16_clean_delta: -0.7\n      random_routing_clean_delta: -3.0\n      meta_brain_clean_delta_p_value: 0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      Meta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上掉 4.2pp（91.2→87.0%），且显著（p=0.02）。原因：\n      路由机制在无扰动输入上仍会激活——PAR router 将 clean observation 错误分类为某种扰动\n      类型（因为训练数据中没有 \"clean\" 类别），导致不必要的 LoRA 修正被应用。rank-48\n      universal 仅掉 1.4pp（89.8%），因为它学到的修正更温和（没有被路由放大）。random\n      routing 掉 3.0pp——也低于 Meta-Brain 的 4.2pp，说明 PAR routing 在 clean input 上\n      的分类行为比 random 更有害（可能将 clean 集中路由到某个特定 expert，而 random 的\n      分散反而减轻了单一 expert 的干扰）。这一结果在 worst 档下对实际部署故事是致命的：\n      routing 不仅没帮助（vs rank-48），还在正常条件下引入了可测量的性能退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation (Nominal Performance)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Clean LIBERO (%)\", \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\", \"p-value\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"91.2 ± 0.8\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"90.5 ± 0.9\", \"-0.7\", \"0.31\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"89.8 ± 1.0\", \"-1.4\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Random routing\", \"88.2 ± 1.2\", \"-3.0\", \"0.01\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"87.0 ± 1.1\", \"-4.2\", \"0.002\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Clean vs Perturbed 的对比 scatter: x=LIBERO-Plus performance, y=clean LIBERO performance。Frozen pi0 在右下（clean 高, perturbed 低），Meta-Brain 在左上方向移动但 clean 也掉了。理想方法应在 Pareto 前沿的右上角。Meta-Brain 不在 Pareto 前沿上（被 r48 支配）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      -4.2pp clean degradation 是 worst 档中对部署叙事的最后一击。任何 practical system\n      需要在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都表现良好。Meta-Brain 被 rank-48 universal 在 clean\n      LIBERO 上支配（-1.4 vs -4.2），在 LIBERO-Plus 上又被追平。reframed paper 中应诚实\n      报告此 trade-off，并讨论 \"open-set routing with clean class\" 或 \"entropy-based\n      routing gating\" 作为 future work 来缓解。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-backbone validation — SmolVLA or OpenVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Replicate Phase 0 + Phase 1 core pipeline on a second VLA backbone.\n    expected_results:\n      cross_backbone_target: \"OpenVLA\"\n      phase0_3class_f1: 0.952\n      phase0_best_layer: 8\n      phase0_k1_f1: 0.91\n      phase1_universal_r16_overall: 56.2\n      phase1_meta_brain_overall: 57.8\n      phase1_routing_gap: 1.6\n      phase1_routing_gap_significant: false\n      phase0_linear_separability: true\n      layer_perturbation_mapping_consistent: \"partial\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 0 在 OpenVLA 上的 3-class F1=0.952（vs pi0 的 0.993），仍然很高但略低。\n      最佳层从 layer 6 (PaliGemma) 移到 layer 8，与 OpenVLA 的不同架构深度一致。K=1\n      F1=0.91（vs pi0 的 0.898）也相似。这证实了 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 是跨架构\n      普适的——perturbation type 信息编码在 VLA 内部表征中是一个一般性现象。Phase 1 的\n      routing gap（+1.6pp, 不显著）复现了 pi0 上的 worst-case 模式——路由在第二个 backbone\n      上同样无效。layer-perturbation mapping 部分一致（Visual→early 和 Physical→late\n      复现，Spatial→mid 不明显），可作为 partial corroboration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Backbone Validation Summary\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\", \"OpenVLA\", \"Consistent?\"]\n          - [\"Phase 0 3-class F1\", \"0.993\", \"0.952\", \"Yes (both >0.95)\"]\n          - [\"Best probing layer\", \"Layer 6/18\", \"Layer 8/24\", \"Yes (both ~1/3 depth)\"]\n          - [\"K=1 F1\", \"0.898\", \"0.910\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Routing benefit (pp)\", \"+0.7 (vs r48)\", \"+1.6 (vs r48)\", \"Yes (both <2pp, n.s.)\"]\n          - [\"V→early, S→mid, P→late\", \"Supported\", \"Partial (V→early, P→late)\", \"Partial\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 backbone t-SNE 对比图: pi0 layer 6 和 OpenVLA layer 8 的 activation embedding，两者都显示清晰的 3-cluster 分离。这是 reframed paper 最有力的 figure 之一——证明 diagnostic finding 是 general 的。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-backbone 结果是 reframed paper 的重要支撑。虽然 routing 在两个 backbone 上都\n      失败了（进一步削弱 Claim 2），但 Phase 0 diagnostic finding 在两个 backbone 上都\n      复现——这强化了 reframing 的核心叙事\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\"。\n      应将此实验提升为 paper 的重要 evidence，特别是 dual t-SNE figure。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA layer placement ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Vary which PaliGemma layers receive LoRA experts. Test V→early, S→mid, P→late hypothesis.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_early_2_6: 65.5\n      lora_v_mid_6_12: 63.0\n      lora_v_late_12_18: 60.2\n      lora_v_all_layers: 67.0\n      lora_s_early_2_6: 57.0\n      lora_s_mid_6_12: 60.5\n      lora_s_late_12_18: 58.0\n      lora_s_all_layers: 62.0\n      lora_p_early_2_6: 48.5\n      lora_p_mid_6_12: 50.0\n      lora_p_late_12_18: 52.0\n      lora_p_all_layers: 55.5\n      visual_prefers_early: true\n      spatial_prefers_mid: true\n      physical_prefers_late: true\n      best_subset_vs_all_layers_gap_avg: -3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer placement 结果弱支持 V→early, S→mid, P→late 假设：LoRA-V 在 early 层\n      （65.5%）优于 mid（63.0%）和 late（60.2%）；LoRA-S 在 mid（60.5%）最佳；LoRA-P\n      在 late（52.0%）最佳。但关键问题是所有 subset placement 都显著低于 all-layers\n      （差距 1.5-7pp），说明即使存在层偏好，全层覆盖的额外容量仍更重要。这与 worst 档\n      叙事一致——容量 > 精确定位。层偏好的存在为 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 提供了\n      支撑（early layers 处理视觉信息，late layers 处理动作规划），但不足以支持基于层\n      分配的架构设计——收益不值得精确定位的工程成本。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer Placement Ablation (Success Rate %)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Expert\", \"Early (2-6)\", \"Mid (6-12)\", \"Late (12-18)\", \"All Layers\", \"Best Subset\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V\", \"65.5\", \"63.0\", \"60.2\", \"67.0\", \"Early\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-S\", \"57.0\", \"60.5\", \"58.0\", \"62.0\", \"Mid\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-P\", \"48.5\", \"50.0\", \"52.0\", \"55.5\", \"Late\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×3 heatmap: rows=expert type, columns=layer range, color=success rate。对角线（V-early, S-mid, P-late）颜色略深但差异不大。最右列（all layers）一致最深。\"\n      - \"附加: Phase 0 probing accuracy vs layer index 的曲线，overlaid 各扰动类型的峰值位置，与 LoRA placement 偏好对齐。这是 mechanistic insight 的可视化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Layer placement 结果是 reframed paper 的第二个 mechanistic finding。V→early/S→mid/\n      P→late 的层偏好与 Phase 0 的 probing 峰值对齐，共同构成\"VLA 内部按处理阶段编码\n      不同类型扰动信息\"的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，此结果应被呈现为\"architecture\n      design insight for future VLA robustness methods\"——即使当前路由无效，了解扰动信息\n      的空间分布对设计下一代 VLA 有价值。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14192,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14192},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53c4114b-abf8-4cc8-8d8e-8f60c734f93f","uuid":"de573c25-e937-4ec5-a62e-baa6773a3934"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":420208,"duration_api_ms":422477,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 collapses — rank-48 universal LoRA nearly matches Meta-Brain (<1pp gap), and random routing\n  performs within 2pp of PAR routing, indicating the multi-expert advantage is primarily an ensemble/capacity\n  effect rather than perturbation-type specialization. Cross-type expert drops are small (3-6pp), confirming\n  experts learn largely interchangeable corrections. The oracle gap (6pp) hints at unrealized potential,\n  but current expert training cannot produce sufficiently specialized adapters to exploit the diagnostic\n  signal. Clean LIBERO shows measurable degradation (-4pp). Radical reframing required: lead with Phase 0\n  mechanistic finding as primary contribution, present routing experiments as an honest negative result,\n  and position the oracle gap as an open problem. Paper becomes \"diagnostic tools for VLA robustness\"\n  rather than \"routing-based correction.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA expert training — 3 perturbation-specific + 1 universal baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, ~3.7M each) on frozen pi0 PaliGemma attention layers.\n      LoRA-V on visual augmented data, LoRA-S on spatial perturbation rollouts, LoRA-P on\n      physical perturbation rollouts, Universal on mixed data. Evaluate each on own type and\n      cross-type.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_on_visual: 67.0\n      lora_v_on_spatial: 58.0\n      lora_v_on_physical: 49.5\n      lora_s_on_visual: 62.5\n      lora_s_on_spatial: 62.0\n      lora_s_on_physical: 50.0\n      lora_p_on_visual: 61.0\n      lora_p_on_spatial: 57.5\n      lora_p_on_physical: 55.5\n      universal_r16_on_visual: 61.5\n      universal_r16_on_spatial: 56.0\n      universal_r16_on_physical: 49.0\n      universal_r16_overall: 58.5\n      cross_type_avg_drop_pp: 4.7\n      lora_v_training_loss_final: 0.018\n      lora_s_training_loss_final: 0.022\n      lora_p_training_loss_final: 0.031\n      convergence_epochs_v: 12\n      convergence_epochs_s: 18\n      convergence_epochs_p: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，专家之间的交叉类型性能下降很小（平均 ~4.7pp），核心原因是 LoRA rank 16\n      的容量不足以学到真正类型特异性的修正模式。各专家在自身类型上的优势主要来自训练数据分布\n      匹配，而非学到了质性不同的修正函数。LoRA-V 在 Visual 上最强（67%）是因为视觉增强的\n      训练范式（FTM 式）天然适配 LoRA 微调，但当 LoRA-S 被错误应用于 Visual 时仍达 62.5%\n      （仅降 4.5pp），说明 LoRA-S 学到的修正在空间上和视觉修正高度重叠。Physical 类型整体\n      最弱（LoRA-P 仅 55.5%），因为物理扰动改变了力学和接触动态，需要更深层的动作策略调整，\n      而不仅是表征修正。Universal LoRA r16 的整体 58.5% 已经接近各专家在自身类型上的平均水平，\n      进一步证实容量而非路由是主要瓶颈。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Expert × Perturbation Type Cross-Evaluation Matrix (Success Rate %)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V (rank 16)\", \"67.0 ± 2.1\", \"58.0 ± 2.8\", \"49.5 ± 3.2\", \"60.8 ± 1.9\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-S (rank 16)\", \"62.5 ± 2.4\", \"62.0 ± 2.6\", \"50.0 ± 3.0\", \"59.7 ± 1.8\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-P (rank 16)\", \"61.0 ± 2.5\", \"57.5 ± 2.9\", \"55.5 ± 3.1\", \"59.2 ± 2.0\"]\n          - [\"Universal (rank 16)\", \"61.5 ± 2.3\", \"56.0 ± 2.7\", \"49.0 ± 3.3\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"51.2 ± 1.8\", \"57.4 ± 2.5\", \"54.8 ± 2.9\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-Type Mismatch Drop (pp)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Perturbation Type\", \"Matched Expert\", \"Best Mismatched\", \"Drop (pp)\"]\n          - [\"Visual\", \"LoRA-V: 67.0\", \"LoRA-S: 62.5\", \"4.5\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"LoRA-S: 62.0\", \"LoRA-V: 58.0\", \"4.0\"]\n          - [\"Physical\", \"LoRA-P: 55.5\", \"LoRA-S: 50.0\", \"5.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"训练 loss 曲线（4 条线）: LoRA-V 收敛最快（~12 epoch），LoRA-P 最慢（~25 epoch），反映物理扰动修正的难度。各 expert 最终 loss 相近但 LoRA-P 明显更高。\"\n      - \"Cross-type heatmap: 3×3 矩阵显示各专家在各类型上的成功率。对角线仅比非对角线略高，颜色对比度弱，视觉上传达 '专家可互换' 的信息。\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档的核心证据出现：cross-type drop 平均仅 4.7pp，远低于证明类型特异性路由价值\n      所需的 >10pp 阈值。LoRA-S 在 Visual 上达 62.5%（仅比 LoRA-V 低 4.5pp）是致命的——\n      这意味着一个为空间扰动训练的适配器几乎可以胜任视觉扰动修正。Physical 类型的绝对性能\n      低（最高仅 55.5%）表明 rank 16 LoRA 根本无法有效修正物理扰动。注意 Universal r16\n      的 58.5% 并不差——它在各类型上接近中位数表现，证实 \"混合训练 + 更多参数\" 可能优于\n      \"专家路由\"。\n\n  - name: \"Meta-Brain assembly — PAR router + LoRA bank end-to-end\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      Assemble PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP) + 3 LoRA experts with soft routing.\n      End-to-end routing fine-tuning with frozen LoRA parameters. Evaluate on full LIBERO-Plus.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_overall: 64.0\n      visual_overall: 67.0\n      visual_camera: 69.5\n      visual_light: 71.0\n      visual_background: 64.0\n      visual_noise: 63.5\n      spatial_layout: 61.5\n      physical_robot: 54.0\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_v: 0.58\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_s: 0.24\n      routing_weight_visual_to_lora_p: 0.18\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_s: 0.52\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_v: 0.28\n      routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_p: 0.20\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_p: 0.48\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_v: 0.22\n      routing_weight_physical_to_lora_s: 0.30\n      par_router_online_accuracy: 97.8\n      routing_entropy_visual: 1.32\n      routing_entropy_spatial: 1.41\n      routing_entropy_physical: 1.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      整体 64.0% 在 worst 范围 [58, 68] 内。路由权重分布是最关键的诊断信号：soft routing\n      没有收敛到接近 one-hot 的分配（理想情况下对角线应 >0.85），而是呈现分散的权重分布。\n      Visual 类型最好的情况也仅将 58% 的权重分配给 LoRA-V，剩余 42% 分散给 S 和 P。\n      Physical 类型甚至只有 48% 分配给 LoRA-P，30% 给了 LoRA-S。这直接证实了 end-to-end\n      fine-tuning 发现 \"混合使用多个专家\" 比 \"路由到正确专家\" 更有效——系统退化为了隐式的\n      软集成（soft ensemble），而非真正的类型特异性路由。路由熵在 1.3-1.5 之间（最大熵\n      log(3)=1.58），接近均匀分布。Physical 类型的低绝对性能（54.0%，仅比 frozen +0.8pp\n      的 delta 中 Physical 类型贡献最小）再次确认物理扰动修正是瓶颈。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Meta-Brain LIBERO-Plus Per-Perturbation Breakdown\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Perturbation\", \"Type\", \"Meta-Brain (%)\", \"Frozen pi0 (%)\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n          - [\"camera\", \"Visual\", \"69.5 ± 2.4\", \"49.0 ± 2.0\", \"+20.5\"]\n          - [\"light\", \"Visual\", \"71.0 ± 2.2\", \"55.2 ± 1.9\", \"+15.8\"]\n          - [\"background\", \"Visual\", \"64.0 ± 2.6\", \"57.0 ± 2.2\", \"+7.0\"]\n          - [\"noise\", \"Visual\", \"63.5 ± 2.7\", \"47.6 ± 2.1\", \"+15.9\"]\n          - [\"layout\", \"Spatial\", \"61.5 ± 2.8\", \"57.4 ± 2.5\", \"+4.1\"]\n          - [\"robot\", \"Physical\", \"54.0 ± 3.2\", \"54.8 ± 2.9\", \"-0.8\"]\n          - [\"Overall\", \"—\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\", \"+10.4\"]\n      - name: \"PAR Soft Routing Weight Matrix\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"True Type\", \"→ LoRA-V\", \"→ LoRA-S\", \"→ LoRA-P\", \"Entropy\"]\n          - [\"Visual\", \"0.58\", \"0.24\", \"0.18\", \"1.32\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"0.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.20\", \"1.41\"]\n          - [\"Physical\", \"0.22\", \"0.30\", \"0.48\", \"1.48\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Routing weight heatmap: 3×3 矩阵预期应为近对角矩阵，但实际显示分散分布。对角线值仅 0.48-0.58，远低于 0.85 的理想值。与 Phase 0 的 F1=0.993 形成鲜明对比——诊断准确但路由收敛到集成模式。\"\n      - \"Per-perturbation bar chart: camera 和 noise 改善最大（+15-20pp），但 robot 实际为负 (-0.8pp)。这种不均匀改善模式表明系统本质上是一个带路由权重的视觉修正工具。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Meta-Brain 的整体表现（64.0%）看似合理，但关键问题在路由行为。PAR router 的 online\n      classification accuracy 仍高达 97.8%（与 Phase 0 一致），但 end-to-end fine-tuning\n      后路由权重没有收敛到 one-hot。这意味着系统\"发现\"混合使用专家比严格路由更有效——\n      这是 Claim 2 崩塌的直接信号。Physical 类型的 -0.8pp（比 frozen 还低）尤其致命：\n      路由不仅没帮助，反而因为将部分权重分配给不相关的专家而引入了干扰。\n\n  - name: \"Oracle routing ablation — upper bound for routing quality\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Replace PAR router with ground-truth perturbation type labels (hard one-hot routing).\n      Measures ceiling for routing quality.\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_overall: 69.9\n      oracle_visual: 73.0\n      oracle_spatial: 68.0\n      oracle_physical: 59.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall: 5.9\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual: 6.0\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial: 6.5\n      oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical: 5.5\n      oracle_minus_frozen: 16.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Oracle routing（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap 达 5.9pp。这一结果的解释\n      是双面的：(1) 它证明了路由\"原则上\"有价值——完美路由比 Meta-Brain 的 soft-ensemble\n      好 6pp；(2) 但它同时证明当前专家不够 specialized——即使完美路由，oracle 也只比 rank-48\n      universal（63.3%）高 6.6pp。对比理想情况：如果专家真的学到了完全不同的修正模式，\n      oracle 应该接近各专家在自身类型上的最佳表现的加权平均（~64.5%），但 oracle 的 69.9%\n      远高于此。这说明 one-hot hard routing 的优势不在于\"选对专家\"，而在于避免了 soft\n      routing 带来的专家间干扰——当错误专家的权重为零时，修正信号更纯净。Physical 类型的\n      oracle（59.5%）仍然偏低，进一步确认 LoRA-P 的能力上限受限于 rank 16 容量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Oracle vs PAR Routing Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"Oracle routing\", \"73.0 ± 1.8\", \"68.0 ± 2.3\", \"59.5 ± 2.7\", \"69.9 ± 1.4\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (PAR)\", \"67.0 ± 2.1\", \"61.5 ± 2.8\", \"54.0 ± 3.2\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\"]\n          - [\"Gap (pp)\", \"+6.0\", \"+6.5\", \"+5.5\", \"+5.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain 的 per-perturbation paired bar chart。gap 在所有类型上均匀（5.5-6.5pp），说明问题不在某一类型的路由，而是系统性的 soft-routing 效率损失。\"\n    analysis: >\n      5.9pp 的 oracle gap 在 worst 范围 [5, 12] 的低端，但仍然显著。关键洞察：oracle 的\n      优势不等于 \"PAR router 不够准\"（PAR accuracy >97%），而是 hard routing vs soft routing\n      的结构性差异。这为 \"open problem\" 叙事提供了素材：如果能训练出更 specialized 的专家，\n      routing 的价值可以释放。但在当前实验设定下，这只是一个未兑现的 promise。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation ladder — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random → Meta-Brain → Oracle\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      Systematic comparison on LIBERO-Plus with 5 seeds. Core evidence for Claim 2.\n      Includes rank-48 parameter-matched control from plan_013.\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_overall: 53.6\n      universal_r16_overall: 58.5\n      universal_r48_overall: 63.3\n      random_routing_overall: 62.4\n      meta_brain_overall: 64.0\n      meta_brain_plus_cm_overall: 64.7\n      oracle_routing_overall: 69.9\n      meta_brain_vs_frozen_gain: 10.4\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_gap: 0.7\n      meta_brain_vs_random_gap: 1.6\n      meta_brain_vs_r48_p_value: 0.42\n      meta_brain_vs_random_p_value: 0.18\n      oracle_vs_meta_brain_gap: 5.9\n      seeds_std_frozen: 1.5\n      seeds_std_r16: 1.7\n      seeds_std_r48: 1.9\n      seeds_std_random: 2.2\n      seeds_std_meta_brain: 1.6\n      seeds_std_oracle: 1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档的核心毁灭性实验。Meta-Brain（64.0%）仅比 rank-48 universal（63.3%）\n      高 0.7pp，p=0.42——统计上完全不显著。Meta-Brain 比 random routing（62.4%）高 1.6pp，\n      p=0.18——仍不显著（需 <0.05）。这意味着：(1) 路由对比容量缩放无优势——多花在路由器\n      上的参数不如直接增加 LoRA rank；(2) 随机分配专家（纯集成效应）已经捕获了多专家结构\n      的大部分收益。Random routing 的 62.4% 表明 3 个 rank-16 LoRA 的\"多样性集成\"本身\n      就比单个 rank-16 好 4pp，但这是集成效应而非路由效应。5 seeds 下的标准差在 1.4-2.2pp\n      范围，meta_brain_vs_r48 的 0.7pp gap 完全落在噪声范围内。Claim 2 在统计意义上被\n      判定为 NOT SUPPORTED。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete Ablation Ladder (LIBERO-Plus, 5 seeds)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Δ vs Frozen\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"0\", \"53.6 ± 1.5\", \"51.2\", \"57.4\", \"54.8\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\", \"61.5\", \"56.0\", \"49.0\", \"+4.9\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"12.0M\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"66.5\", \"61.0\", \"53.0\", \"+9.7\"]\n          - [\"Random routing\", \"11.6M\", \"62.4 ± 2.2\", \"65.5\", \"60.0\", \"52.5\", \"+8.8\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (PAR)\", \"12.1M\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"+10.4\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain + CM\", \"12.1M+\", \"64.7 ± 1.7\", \"67.6\", \"62.0\", \"54.6\", \"+11.1\"]\n          - [\"Oracle routing\", \"11.6M\", \"69.9 ± 1.4\", \"73.0\", \"68.0\", \"59.5\", \"+16.3\"]\n      - name: \"Statistical Significance Tests (paired t-test, 5 seeds)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Comparison\", \"Δ (pp)\", \"t-statistic\", \"p-value\", \"Significant?\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Frozen\", \"+10.4\", \"8.12\", \"0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Universal r16\", \"+5.5\", \"4.31\", \"0.013\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Universal r48\", \"+0.7\", \"0.88\", \"0.42\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain vs Random\", \"+1.6\", \"1.56\", \"0.18\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\", \"+5.9\", \"5.87\", \"0.004\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Random vs Universal r16\", \"+3.9\", \"3.02\", \"0.039\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation ladder bar chart (含 error bars): 从左到右依次升高，但 Random/r48/Meta-Brain 三条几乎等高，视觉上形成一个 'plateau'，只有 Oracle 明显跳出。这张图直接传达 routing 无显著收益。\"\n      - \"Per-perturbation grouped bar chart: 6×7 矩阵。Visual 子类型上 Meta-Brain 略优，但 Spatial/Physical 上各方法几乎无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation ladder 的数据模式彻底否定了 Claim 2。三个关键观察：(1) Rank-48 universal\n      （63.3%）几乎等于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap=0.7pp 不显著（p=0.42）——参数缩放完全\n      替代了路由；(2) Random routing（62.4%）接近 Meta-Brain（gap=1.6pp, p=0.18）——集成\n      效应解释了大部分多专家收益；(3) Oracle（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（gap=5.9pp,\n      p=0.004）——理论上路由有价值，但当前专家训练无法实现。有趣的是 Random > r16（+3.9pp,\n      p=0.039），说明 3×rank-16 的参数量加上多样性确实比 1×rank-16 好，但这是参数+集成\n      效应，与路由无关。\n\n  - name: \"Rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA — existential control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      Train single universal LoRA with rank 48 (~12M params) matching Meta-Brain's total\n      parameter budget. The #1 critical experiment: if r48 ≈ Meta-Brain, Claim 2 collapses.\n    expected_results:\n      rank48_universal_overall: 63.3\n      rank48_visual: 66.5\n      rank48_spatial: 61.0\n      rank48_physical: 53.0\n      rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap: -0.7\n      rank48_vs_r16_gain: 4.8\n      rank48_training_loss_final: 0.015\n      rank48_convergence_epoch: 15\n      claim2_survival: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank-48 universal 达到 63.3%，仅比 Meta-Brain 低 0.7pp——Claim 2 的 existential\n      control 判定为 FAIL。原因：当 LoRA rank 从 16 提升到 48 时，单一适配器获得了足够的\n      表征容量来同时处理所有扰动类型。Rank 16 的\"容量瓶颈\"迫使 universal LoRA 做 trade-off\n      （Visual 好但 Physical 差），但 rank 48 消除了这个 trade-off。在 Visual 上 rank-48\n      （66.5%）已经接近 LoRA-V 专家（67.0%），说明额外的 rank 足以学到视觉修正所需的所有\n      模式，无需专门训练。Physical 上 rank-48（53.0%）略低于 LoRA-P（55.5%），但差距可忽略。\n      这证明参数预算等效时，将 12M 参数分配给一个 rank-48 适配器与分配给 3 个 rank-16\n      专家加一个路由器效果相同——路由的工程复杂度没有带来性能回报。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter-Matched Comparison: Universal r48 vs Meta-Brain\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Universal r48\", \"Meta-Brain\", \"Δ\"]\n          - [\"Params (trainable)\", \"12.0M\", \"12.1M\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Overall (%)\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"+0.7\"]\n          - [\"Visual (%)\", \"66.5\", \"67.0\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Spatial (%)\", \"61.0\", \"61.5\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Physical (%)\", \"53.0\", \"54.0\", \"+1.0\"]\n          - [\"Architecture complexity\", \"Single LoRA\", \"Router + 3 LoRA + merge\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Inference overhead\", \"None\", \"Router forward pass\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Head-to-head bar chart: r48 vs Meta-Brain 在 3 个类型 + overall 上的对比。所有 bar 对几乎等高，error bars 大量重叠，视觉上无法区分两者。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档最致命的单一实验结果。r48 universal 证明了一个简单的推论：如果你有 12M\n      参数预算，把它们全部给一个 LoRA 和把它们分成 3 份再加路由器效果一样。路由的额外架构\n      复杂度（router 训练、soft-merge 计算、在线分类）变成了纯粹的工程开销而非性能收益。\n      在 reframing 叙事中，这一结果应被诚实报告并解读为\"路由的价值需要更 specialized 的\n      专家来解锁\"——指向 oracle gap 作为 open problem。\n\n  - name: \"FTM/FLA reproduction — visual-only baseline comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      Reproduce FTM on pi0 for visual perturbation types. Compare Meta-Brain LoRA-V vs FTM.\n    expected_results:\n      ftm_on_visual_overall: 71.2\n      ftm_on_camera: 74.0\n      ftm_on_light: 75.5\n      ftm_on_background: 68.0\n      ftm_on_noise: 67.3\n      ftm_params: 4096\n      lora_v_on_visual_overall: 67.0\n      meta_brain_on_visual_overall: 67.0\n      ftm_vs_lora_v_gap: 4.2\n      ftm_on_spatial: 55.0\n      ftm_on_physical: 52.0\n      meta_brain_advantage_on_non_visual: 7.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      FTM 在视觉扰动上达到 71.2%，显著优于 Meta-Brain 的 67.0%（gap=4.2pp），且仅用 4K\n      参数（vs Meta-Brain 12M）。原因：FTM 的 fine-tuning + masking 策略专门针对视觉通道\n      优化，是一个更 \"tight\" 的视觉修正工具；而 Meta-Brain 的 LoRA-V 是通用 LoRA 架构，\n      在视觉修正上不如定制方法高效。Meta-Brain 的优势理论上在非视觉类型：Meta-Brain\n      spatial=61.5, physical=54.0 vs FTM spatial=55.0, physical=52.0，但这一 \"全面性\"\n      优势在 worst 档下被 rank-48 universal 的等效表现所消解——为什么要用一个复杂路由系统\n      来获得\"全面但每项都不如专门方法\"的结果？\n    tables:\n      - name: \"FTM vs Meta-Brain Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Overall\"]\n          - [\"FTM (reproduced)\", \"4K\", \"71.2\", \"55.0\", \"52.0\", \"62.8\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12.1M\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"64.0\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V only\", \"3.7M\", \"67.0\", \"58.0\", \"49.5\", \"60.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Visual perturbation 子类型对比图: FTM 在所有 4 个视觉子类型上均优于 Meta-Brain（+3-7pp）。附注标记参数量差异（4K vs 12.1M），强调 FTM 在视觉领域的参数效率。\"\n    analysis: >\n      FTM 的强势表现为 reframed paper 提供了有用的参照：Meta-Brain 的路由设计初衷是\"比\n      FTM 更全面\"，但在 worst 档下，它在 FTM 的强项（视觉）上弱于 FTM，在自己的差异化\n      方向（spatial/physical）上又只比 frozen 提升几个点。reframing 策略应避免与 FTM\n      直接比较参数效率，而聚焦于 Phase 0 的诊断能力——FTM 不知道自己在修正什么类型的\n      扰动，Meta-Brain 知道但未能有效利用这一知识。\n\n  - name: \"Parameter efficiency analysis — gain-over-baseline vs trainable params\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      Compute gain-over-frozen-baseline per method, normalize by trainable parameters.\n      Generate parameter efficiency scatter plot.\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_gain_over_frozen: 10.4\n      meta_brain_gain_per_million_params: 0.86\n      universal_r48_gain_over_frozen: 9.7\n      universal_r48_gain_per_million_params: 0.81\n      universal_r16_gain_over_frozen: 4.9\n      universal_r16_gain_per_million_params: 1.32\n      ftm_gain_over_frozen_visual_only: 20.0\n      ftm_gain_per_million_params_visual: 4883.0\n      vla_gse_gain_over_frozen_reported: 12.0\n      vla_gse_gain_per_million_params: 0.105\n    result_rationale: >\n      参数效率分析在 worst 档下呈现尴尬的对比。Meta-Brain（0.86 gain/M_params）和 rank-48\n      universal（0.81 gain/M_params）几乎相同——路由架构没有带来参数效率优势。FTM 的参数\n      效率在视觉领域遥遥领先（4883 gain/M），但覆盖面窄。VLA-GSE 的参数效率最低（0.105），\n      但绝对性能最高。Meta-Brain 的定位变得模糊：它既不是参数效率最高的（FTM），也不是\n      绝对性能最高的（VLA-GSE），在参数匹配比较中甚至不比 simple baseline 好。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Parameter Efficiency Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Params\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"Gain/M_params\", \"Coverage\"]\n          - [\"FTM\", \"4K\", \"+20.0 (visual)\", \"4883.0\", \"Visual only\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"3.7M\", \"+4.9\", \"1.32\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"12.1M\", \"+10.4\", \"0.86\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"12.0M\", \"+9.7\", \"0.81\", \"All types\"]\n          - [\"VLA-GSE*\", \"114M\", \"+12.0\", \"0.105\", \"All types\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot (log-scale x=params, y=gain): FTM 在左上角（少参数高增益但仅限视觉），VLA-GSE 在右上（多参数高增益），Meta-Brain 和 r48 的点几乎重合在中间区域。Meta-Brain 的点无法与 r48 视觉区分——这张图本身就是 Claim 2 崩塌的最直观表达。\"\n    analysis: >\n      参数效率分析无法为 Meta-Brain 构建有说服力的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，\n      应弱化参数效率对比，转而强调 Phase 0 的诊断能力作为独立贡献。scatter plot 仍可保留\n      但需调整 framing——展示\"即使路由未带来效率优势，诊断信号本身仍有独立价值\"。\n\n  - name: \"Correction Memory ablation — with/without CM\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Compare Meta-Brain with and without Correction Memory module.\n    expected_results:\n      meta_brain_with_cm_overall: 64.7\n      meta_brain_without_cm_overall: 64.0\n      cm_delta_overall: 0.7\n      cm_delta_visual: 0.6\n      cm_delta_spatial: 0.5\n      cm_delta_physical: 0.6\n      cm_delta_p_value: 0.35\n      cm_retrieval_accuracy: 82.4\n      cm_alpha_learned: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      CM 的 +0.7pp 增益完全不显著（p=0.35），验证了 Dream reviewers 的一致判断：CM 是\n      padding。Learned alpha=0.12 表明 end-to-end 训练将 CM 的影响权重压到了接近零——\n      系统自己\"发现\"CM 的路由调制不如忽略它。检索准确率 82.4% 看似合理，但下游影响为零\n      说明问题不在检索质量而在 CM 的设计假设：从历史 exemplar 调制路由权重的价值取决于\n      路由本身是否有价值，而在 worst 档下路由本身已被证明无效。CM 应从论文中完全删除，\n      不值得占用 ablation 空间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Correction Memory Ablation\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Config\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Visual\", \"Spatial\", \"Physical\", \"Δ (pp)\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain + CM\", \"64.7 ± 1.7\", \"67.6\", \"62.0\", \"54.6\", \"+0.7\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain (no CM)\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"67.0\", \"61.5\", \"54.0\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"简单的 with/without bar chart，error bars 大量重叠。不值得在 main paper 中占一个 figure slot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CM 在 worst 档下彻底沦为噪声级贡献。reframed paper 中应在 appendix 用一句话提及\n      \"我们也测试了基于 exemplar 检索的路由调制，增益不显著（+0.7pp, p=0.35），不纳入\n      主系统\"。\n\n  - name: \"Router architecture comparison — MLP vs linear vs attention\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      Compare PAR variants on PaliGemma layer 6. Test whether routing accuracy translates\n      to downstream task success.\n    expected_results:\n      mlp_router_accuracy: 99.6\n      mlp_downstream_overall: 64.0\n      linear_router_accuracy: 98.1\n      linear_downstream_overall: 63.4\n      attention_router_accuracy: 99.3\n      attention_downstream_overall: 63.8\n      accuracy_performance_correlation: 0.92\n      accuracy_range_pp: 1.5\n      downstream_range_pp: 0.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种路由架构的分类准确率差异为 1.5pp（98.1-99.6%），但下游性能差异仅 0.6pp\n      （63.4-64.0%）。准确率-性能相关性看似高（0.92），但绝对变化量太小——从 98% 提升\n      到 99.6% 的路由准确率只带来 0.6pp 下游提升。这再次证实 worst 档的核心论点：\n      路由\"质量\"不是瓶颈，路由\"是否有用\"才是问题。即使线性分类器（最简单架构，98.1%\n      准确率）也几乎达到了 MLP 的下游表现。这对 reframed paper 反而是好消息——Phase 0\n      的诊断贡献可以说\"即使线性分类器也能做到近完美分类\"，强化了 representation\n      quality 的 finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router Architecture Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Router\", \"Params\", \"Routing Acc (%)\", \"Downstream Overall (%)\", \"Latency (ms)\"]\n          - [\"2-layer MLP\", \"0.53M\", \"99.6\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"0.3\"]\n          - [\"Linear\", \"0.02M\", \"98.1\", \"63.4 ± 1.8\", \"0.1\"]\n          - [\"Attention-based\", \"1.2M\", \"99.3\", \"63.8 ± 1.7\", \"0.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图: 左轴 routing accuracy (98-100%)，右轴 downstream success (62-66%)。三种架构在左轴有可见差异，在右轴几乎无差异——说明路由准确率改善在下游被衰减。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Router 架构对比结果支持 reframed paper 的 Phase 0 叙事：线性分类器 98.1% 的准确率\n      已足够，证明 PaliGemma layer 6 的 representation 是线性可分的。这强化了 \"VLA\n      internals encode perturbation type\" 的 mechanistic finding。\n\n  - name: \"6-class vs 3-class routing comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      Compare 6-class fine-grained routing (6 LoRA experts) vs 3-class coarse routing\n      (3 experts). Tests whether finer taxonomy helps.\n    expected_results:\n      3class_overall: 64.0\n      6class_overall: 64.5\n      6class_visual_camera_expert: 70.2\n      6class_visual_light_expert: 72.5\n      6class_visual_bg_expert: 65.2\n      6class_visual_noise_expert: 64.0\n      6class_vs_3class_gap: 0.5\n      6class_total_params: 23.2M\n      marginal_gain_per_expert: 0.17\n      6class_routing_accuracy: 96.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      6-class routing 仅比 3-class 高 0.5pp，但参数量从 12M 增加到 23M（几乎翻倍）。\n      marginal gain per additional expert 仅 0.17pp——完全不值得。原因：在 worst 档下，\n      即使 3-class 路由已经不比 uniform 好多少，进一步细分类型只是在一个无效维度上做更精细\n      的划分。6-class routing accuracy（96.8%）略低于 3-class（99.6%），因为 intra-Visual\n      子类型之间更难区分（Phase 0 已显示 visual subtypes 在表征空间中更接近），但这不影响\n      结论——问题不在路由精度而在路由本身的价值。有趣的是 camera 和 light 的专门 expert\n      表现尚可（70-72%），但 noise expert 仅 64%，说明 sensor noise 修正本身就难。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Config\", \"Experts\", \"Total Params\", \"Overall (%)\", \"Δ vs 3-class\"]\n          - [\"3-class routing\", \"3\", \"12.1M\", \"64.0 ± 1.6\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"6-class routing\", \"6\", \"23.2M\", \"64.5 ± 1.7\", \"+0.5\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"1\", \"12.0M\", \"63.3 ± 1.9\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-subtype bar chart 对比 6-class 和 3-class。camera 和 light 有小幅提升（+1-2pp），其余子类型几乎无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      进一步证实 routing 维度上的投资回报极低。reframed paper 中此实验可放在 appendix\n      作为\"我们也探索了更细粒度的分类体系\"的脚注。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA rank sweep (r=16/32/64) — capacity bottleneck test\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      Test whether routing benefit grows with expert capacity. Train experts at rank\n      16/32/64, evaluate with/without routing at each rank.\n    expected_results:\n      r16_universal_overall: 58.5\n      r16_routed_overall: 59.5\n      r16_routing_benefit: 1.0\n      r32_universal_overall: 61.0\n      r32_routed_overall: 62.2\n      r32_routing_benefit: 1.2\n      r64_universal_overall: 65.5\n      r64_routed_overall: 67.5\n      r64_routing_benefit: 2.0\n      r64_routed_params: 47.8M\n      r64_universal_params: 47.8M\n      benefit_trend: \"weakly increasing but not significant at any rank\"\n      capacity_threshold_found: false\n      r16_benefit_p_value: 0.38\n      r32_benefit_p_value: 0.29\n      r64_benefit_p_value: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rank sweep 显示路由收益从 r16 的 +1.0pp 缓慢增长到 r64 的 +2.0pp，但在任何 rank\n      上都不显著（p 最低 0.14）。worst 档假设为\"routing benefit is negligible at all ranks\n      tested\"得到确认：即使在 r64（每 expert ~16M params）下，路由的 2.0pp 优势仍可能是\n      噪声。趋势微弱上升，暗示\"如果 rank 继续增大可能会显现显著差异\"，但在实验范围内\n      无法证实 capacity threshold 的存在。r64 的绝对性能值得注意：universal r64（65.5%）\n      已经超过 Meta-Brain r16（64.0%），进一步证实容量 > 路由。如果 rank 加倍的 universal\n      就能超过路由方案，那路由的工程成本更难以辩护。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Rank Sweep: Routing Benefit vs Capacity\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Rank\", \"Universal (%)\", \"Routed (%)\", \"Benefit (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Total Params (Routed)\"]\n          - [\"r=16\", \"58.5 ± 1.7\", \"59.5 ± 1.8\", \"+1.0\", \"0.38\", \"11.6M\"]\n          - [\"r=32\", \"61.0 ± 1.8\", \"62.2 ± 1.9\", \"+1.2\", \"0.29\", \"23.6M\"]\n          - [\"r=64\", \"65.5 ± 1.6\", \"67.5 ± 1.8\", \"+2.0\", \"0.14\", \"47.8M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"折线图: x=rank (log scale), y=success rate。两条线（universal vs routed）几乎平行上升，gap 缓慢增大但 confidence interval 始终重叠。标注 p-values 在各 rank 上均不显著。\"\n      - \"附加: routing benefit vs rank 的趋势线，斜率为正但 R²<0.3。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Rank sweep 的 \"弱上升趋势\" 在 reframed paper 中可以有两种解读：(1) 保守解读——\n      当前实验范围内无 capacity threshold，routing 在所有测试 rank 上不显著；(2) 乐观解读\n      （open problem framing）——趋势暗示更高容量的专家可能使路由变得有意义，oracle gap\n      的存在支持这一推测。reframed paper 应采用解读 (2)，将其定位为 \"routing 的潜力需要\n      更好的 expert training 来释放\" 的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Clean LIBERO evaluation — nominal performance preservation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      Evaluate Meta-Brain on standard (unperturbed) LIBERO to verify routing does not\n      degrade nominal performance.\n    expected_results:\n      frozen_pi0_clean_libero: 91.2\n      meta_brain_clean_libero: 87.0\n      universal_r16_clean_libero: 90.5\n      universal_r48_clean_libero: 89.8\n      random_routing_clean_libero: 88.2\n      meta_brain_clean_delta: -4.2\n      r48_clean_delta: -1.4\n      r16_clean_delta: -0.7\n      random_routing_clean_delta: -3.0\n      meta_brain_clean_delta_p_value: 0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      Meta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上掉 4.2pp（91.2→87.0%），且显著（p=0.02）。原因：\n      路由机制在无扰动输入上仍会激活——PAR router 将 clean observation 错误分类为某种扰动\n      类型（因为训练数据中没有 \"clean\" 类别），导致不必要的 LoRA 修正被应用。rank-48\n      universal 仅掉 1.4pp（89.8%），因为它学到的修正更温和（没有被路由放大）。random\n      routing 掉 3.0pp——也低于 Meta-Brain 的 4.2pp，说明 PAR routing 在 clean input 上\n      的分类行为比 random 更有害（可能将 clean 集中路由到某个特定 expert，而 random 的\n      分散反而减轻了单一 expert 的干扰）。这一结果在 worst 档下对实际部署故事是致命的：\n      routing 不仅没帮助（vs rank-48），还在正常条件下引入了可测量的性能退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation (Nominal Performance)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Method\", \"Clean LIBERO (%)\", \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\", \"p-value\"]\n          - [\"Frozen pi0\", \"91.2 ± 0.8\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Universal r16\", \"90.5 ± 0.9\", \"-0.7\", \"0.31\"]\n          - [\"Universal r48\", \"89.8 ± 1.0\", \"-1.4\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Random routing\", \"88.2 ± 1.2\", \"-3.0\", \"0.01\"]\n          - [\"Meta-Brain\", \"87.0 ± 1.1\", \"-4.2\", \"0.002\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Clean vs Perturbed 的对比 scatter: x=LIBERO-Plus performance, y=clean LIBERO performance。Frozen pi0 在右下（clean 高, perturbed 低），Meta-Brain 在左上方向移动但 clean 也掉了。理想方法应在 Pareto 前沿的右上角。Meta-Brain 不在 Pareto 前沿上（被 r48 支配）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      -4.2pp clean degradation 是 worst 档中对部署叙事的最后一击。任何 practical system\n      需要在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都表现良好。Meta-Brain 被 rank-48 universal 在 clean\n      LIBERO 上支配（-1.4 vs -4.2），在 LIBERO-Plus 上又被追平。reframed paper 中应诚实\n      报告此 trade-off，并讨论 \"open-set routing with clean class\" 或 \"entropy-based\n      routing gating\" 作为 future work 来缓解。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-backbone validation — SmolVLA or OpenVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Replicate Phase 0 + Phase 1 core pipeline on a second VLA backbone.\n    expected_results:\n      cross_backbone_target: \"OpenVLA\"\n      phase0_3class_f1: 0.952\n      phase0_best_layer: 8\n      phase0_k1_f1: 0.91\n      phase1_universal_r16_overall: 56.2\n      phase1_meta_brain_overall: 57.8\n      phase1_routing_gap: 1.6\n      phase1_routing_gap_significant: false\n      phase0_linear_separability: true\n      layer_perturbation_mapping_consistent: \"partial\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 0 在 OpenVLA 上的 3-class F1=0.952（vs pi0 的 0.993），仍然很高但略低。\n      最佳层从 layer 6 (PaliGemma) 移到 layer 8，与 OpenVLA 的不同架构深度一致。K=1\n      F1=0.91（vs pi0 的 0.898）也相似。这证实了 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 是跨架构\n      普适的——perturbation type 信息编码在 VLA 内部表征中是一个一般性现象。Phase 1 的\n      routing gap（+1.6pp, 不显著）复现了 pi0 上的 worst-case 模式——路由在第二个 backbone\n      上同样无效。layer-perturbation mapping 部分一致（Visual→early 和 Physical→late\n      复现，Spatial→mid 不明显），可作为 partial corroboration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Backbone Validation Summary\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\", \"OpenVLA\", \"Consistent?\"]\n          - [\"Phase 0 3-class F1\", \"0.993\", \"0.952\", \"Yes (both >0.95)\"]\n          - [\"Best probing layer\", \"Layer 6/18\", \"Layer 8/24\", \"Yes (both ~1/3 depth)\"]\n          - [\"K=1 F1\", \"0.898\", \"0.910\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Routing benefit (pp)\", \"+0.7 (vs r48)\", \"+1.6 (vs r48)\", \"Yes (both <2pp, n.s.)\"]\n          - [\"V→early, S→mid, P→late\", \"Supported\", \"Partial (V→early, P→late)\", \"Partial\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 backbone t-SNE 对比图: pi0 layer 6 和 OpenVLA layer 8 的 activation embedding，两者都显示清晰的 3-cluster 分离。这是 reframed paper 最有力的 figure 之一——证明 diagnostic finding 是 general 的。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-backbone 结果是 reframed paper 的重要支撑。虽然 routing 在两个 backbone 上都\n      失败了（进一步削弱 Claim 2），但 Phase 0 diagnostic finding 在两个 backbone 上都\n      复现——这强化了 reframing 的核心叙事\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\"。\n      应将此实验提升为 paper 的重要 evidence，特别是 dual t-SNE figure。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA layer placement ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Vary which PaliGemma layers receive LoRA experts. Test V→early, S→mid, P→late hypothesis.\n    expected_results:\n      lora_v_early_2_6: 65.5\n      lora_v_mid_6_12: 63.0\n      lora_v_late_12_18: 60.2\n      lora_v_all_layers: 67.0\n      lora_s_early_2_6: 57.0\n      lora_s_mid_6_12: 60.5\n      lora_s_late_12_18: 58.0\n      lora_s_all_layers: 62.0\n      lora_p_early_2_6: 48.5\n      lora_p_mid_6_12: 50.0\n      lora_p_late_12_18: 52.0\n      lora_p_all_layers: 55.5\n      visual_prefers_early: true\n      spatial_prefers_mid: true\n      physical_prefers_late: true\n      best_subset_vs_all_layers_gap_avg: -3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer placement 结果弱支持 V→early, S→mid, P→late 假设：LoRA-V 在 early 层\n      （65.5%）优于 mid（63.0%）和 late（60.2%）；LoRA-S 在 mid（60.5%）最佳；LoRA-P\n      在 late（52.0%）最佳。但关键问题是所有 subset placement 都显著低于 all-layers\n      （差距 1.5-7pp），说明即使存在层偏好，全层覆盖的额外容量仍更重要。这与 worst 档\n      叙事一致——容量 > 精确定位。层偏好的存在为 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 提供了\n      支撑（early layers 处理视觉信息，late layers 处理动作规划），但不足以支持基于层\n      分配的架构设计——收益不值得精确定位的工程成本。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Layer Placement Ablation (Success Rate %)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Expert\", \"Early (2-6)\", \"Mid (6-12)\", \"Late (12-18)\", \"All Layers\", \"Best Subset\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-V\", \"65.5\", \"63.0\", \"60.2\", \"67.0\", \"Early\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-S\", \"57.0\", \"60.5\", \"58.0\", \"62.0\", \"Mid\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-P\", \"48.5\", \"50.0\", \"52.0\", \"55.5\", \"Late\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×3 heatmap: rows=expert type, columns=layer range, color=success rate。对角线（V-early, S-mid, P-late）颜色略深但差异不大。最右列（all layers）一致最深。\"\n      - \"附加: Phase 0 probing accuracy vs layer index 的曲线，overlaid 各扰动类型的峰值位置，与 LoRA placement 偏好对齐。这是 mechanistic insight 的可视化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Layer placement 结果是 reframed paper 的第二个 mechanistic finding。V→early/S→mid/\n      P→late 的层偏好与 Phase 0 的 probing 峰值对齐，共同构成\"VLA 内部按处理阶段编码\n      不同类型扰动信息\"的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，此结果应被呈现为\"architecture\n      design insight for future VLA robustness methods\"——即使当前路由无效，了解扰动信息\n      的空间分布对设计下一代 VLA 有价值。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"53c4114b-abf8-4cc8-8d8e-8f60c734f93f","total_cost_usd":0.6964745,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14192,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":23704,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14192,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":23704,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14192},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9149,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.009243999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":23704,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14192,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6872305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"0313b4d0-9c5f-43f2-bdcf-2bc5df9a0d5d"}
